   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Source and artifacts",
   "items": [
    "main is prod, dev is integration, feature/** is work; both protected by PR + green CI",
    "sync-main.yml auto-PRs main into open feature branches; CODEOWNERS assigns reviewers",
    "No shared library or parent POM: every service builds alone; images tagged by commit SHA"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Procedures",
   "items": [
    "CI runs the same make aws-deploy a developer runs: no YAML reimplementation",
    "make aws-up-<env> provisions (~20 min); aws-deploy ships code (~3 min); aws-down-<env> tears down",
    "Preflight skips the deploy if the Environment has no AWS role configured"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Bugs the pipeline taught us",
   "items": [
    "Deploy Dev used to ship main's code: workflow_run's github.sha is the default branch",
